### Listar posts
GET http://localhost:3000/posts

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "enzo@gmail.com", "senha": "123456" }

### Novo post
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "enzooliverr_", "imagem": "https://placehold.co/600x400", "texto": "Meu post" }

### Curtir
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1

### Configurações (trocar nome, bio e foto)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "enzooliverr_", "bio": "Minha nova bio" }
